  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>Having used a particular seal over and over again, you have learned how best to manipulate fate in the precise manner required to elicit the effects of that seal.</p>\n<p><strong>Prerequisite:</strong> Know at least 3 seals</p>\n<p><strong>Benefit:</strong> Choose a seal you know. The fate point cost of that seal is reduced by 1, to a minimum of 1.</p>\n<p><strong>Special:</strong> You can gain this feat multiple times. Each time, select another seal to which this feat has not been applied.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/cartomancy-feats#toc7\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
